flowchart TD
    controls[Editor Game tab] --> select[Select existing game YAML inside res]
    select --> config[Validate HUD references and retain configuration]
    controls --> play[Play Saved Scene]
    play --> guard{Saved scene and no invalid drafts?}
    guard -->|No| error[Display validation error]
    guard -->|Yes| validate[Revalidate configuration and saved scene paths]
    validate --> generated[Write unique build/.editor-play directory]
    generated --> spawn[posix_spawn runtime --config generated settings]
    spawn --> runtime[Separate runtime VM and Registry]
    runtime --> output[Capture stdout and stderr in output.log]
    runtime --> poll[Poll only owned child PID]
    poll --> status[Show exit code or signal and log path]
    controls --> stop[Stop Play]
    stop --> reap[TERM owned child; bounded wait; KILL if needed; reap]
    shutdown[Editor shutdown] --> reap
    document[Authored SceneSession] --> guard
